<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG Metals says don't worry on LME options.</title>
<headline>LG Metals says don't worry on LME options.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG Metals Corp said on Friday the market has no need to worry about its current open metal options positions, declining to comment on rumours on the London Metal Exchange (LME) that it was facing huge losses.</p>
</text>
